{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/dce65436ec388b594bea7b4e113fd365.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEART DRIVE is an action adventure spin on the fishing game genre, with a focus on driving, upgrading and narration. Set in a connected overworld, it\u2019s sprawling with fantasy, sci-fi and paranormal elements. Meet quirky characters, upgrade your equipment and embark on a journey of action, friendship and letting go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what the heck is a \u201cHeart Drive\u201d anyway?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/9ab2c1bea0f1750caaf2bf0e33091362.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span>Control the three friends Hedda, Lore and Spitzweg on their adventure of finding an ancient machine ghost, travelling through the \u201eElseweird\u201c, a forgotten pocket dimension filled with mystery and, well, a lot of expired wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/998d5b4fb224fbc048376f250e9f459d.poster.avif?t=1762522104\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/998d5b4fb224fbc048376f250e9f459d.webm?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/998d5b4fb224fbc048376f250e9f459d.mp4?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/9c6f57b8b0b4db6e58fb370fc3f06715.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span>This world is home to the \u201eTape Fish\u201c, mysterious ancient machines roaming the lands. They do look like fish, and even smell a bit like fish, but that is probably the sea water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're gonna need all your driving skills and fishing wit to catch these strange beasts and uncover their value, as well as their secrets. You may know fishing as a stationary job, but when your haul starts yanking you out of your seat, you probably have to get a faster seat!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/d0284fe64602f82c28baff462ff1af6a.poster.avif?t=1762522104\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/d0284fe64602f82c28baff462ff1af6a.webm?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/d0284fe64602f82c28baff462ff1af6a.mp4?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/92dc5577c6b04a8beb9882c1a0fba330.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span>To achieve your fishing goals you need a fast, stylish vehicle. You have\u2026 Hedda\u2019s old car. And even the best mage mechanist can repair the engines just so-and-so many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, sell your haul and upgrade it! Buy tires, change the paintjob or discover new merchants for even better upgrades! Tape-fishing is tricky business, and catching those slippery automatons calls for the right gadgets - and style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/39618b926798ae2afee8c74abe65e541.poster.avif?t=1762522104\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/39618b926798ae2afee8c74abe65e541.webm?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/39618b926798ae2afee8c74abe65e541.mp4?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>MAIN FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing-Action Extravaganza:</strong>\u00a0 Why wait for the fish to bite, if you can race it? Chase giant fish with your car while trying to catch them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story full of characters:</strong> Meet grumpy mermen, bad songwriters, mythological beings, mechanical shopkeepers and more. They are on their journey, just as you are on yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Unlock new parts for your car, customize its loadout and paint jobs to catch fish your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gotta Snatch \u2019Em All:</strong> Catalog the colorful fauna and uncover its weird origin.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discovery:</strong> Long forgotten tunnels, giant skeletons, holes in space and time, and, yes, even a burger joint is here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snackable:</strong> Play a tight gaming experience, perfect for some evenings or a long weekend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.............................................................................................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi it's Jonas, the developer! :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HEART DRIVE has been a passion project of mine for some time now. It's something I put all my love into, but also something I have to do on the side for now. If you want to stay in touch, or have questions, follow me on Bluesky or Insta. Wishlists help a lot, as always, and look out for any future demo!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>See you, tape fishers! \u270c\ufe0f\ud83c\udfa3\ud83d\ude97</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026760?t=1762522104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/2bba079339b6fed53263ac77b69cacf9fd35375b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762522104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/44eae8f473fac73d2506c90c2e82b8b414ef2f59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762522104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/44eae8f473fac73d2506c90c2e82b8b414ef2f59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762522104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/dce65436ec388b594bea7b4e113fd365.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEART DRIVE is an action adventure spin on the fishing game genre, with a focus on driving, upgrading and narration. Set in a connected overworld, it\u2019s sprawling with fantasy, sci-fi and paranormal elements. Meet quirky characters, upgrade your equipment and embark on a journey of action, friendship and letting go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what the heck is a \u201cHeart Drive\u201d anyway?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/9ab2c1bea0f1750caaf2bf0e33091362.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span>Control the three friends Hedda, Lore and Spitzweg on their adventure of finding an ancient machine ghost, travelling through the \u201eElseweird\u201c, a forgotten pocket dimension filled with mystery and, well, a lot of expired wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/998d5b4fb224fbc048376f250e9f459d.poster.avif?t=1762522104\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/998d5b4fb224fbc048376f250e9f459d.webm?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/998d5b4fb224fbc048376f250e9f459d.mp4?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/9c6f57b8b0b4db6e58fb370fc3f06715.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span>This world is home to the \u201eTape Fish\u201c, mysterious ancient machines roaming the lands. They do look like fish, and even smell a bit like fish, but that is probably the sea water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're gonna need all your driving skills and fishing wit to catch these strange beasts and uncover their value, as well as their secrets. You may know fishing as a stationary job, but when your haul starts yanking you out of your seat, you probably have to get a faster seat!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/d0284fe64602f82c28baff462ff1af6a.poster.avif?t=1762522104\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/d0284fe64602f82c28baff462ff1af6a.webm?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/d0284fe64602f82c28baff462ff1af6a.mp4?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/92dc5577c6b04a8beb9882c1a0fba330.webp?t=1762522104\" width=900 height=60 /></span>To achieve your fishing goals you need a fast, stylish vehicle. You have\u2026 Hedda\u2019s old car. And even the best mage mechanist can repair the engines just so-and-so many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, sell your haul and upgrade it! Buy tires, change the paintjob or discover new merchants for even better upgrades! Tape-fishing is tricky business, and catching those slippery automatons calls for the right gadgets - and style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/39618b926798ae2afee8c74abe65e541.poster.avif?t=1762522104\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/39618b926798ae2afee8c74abe65e541.webm?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/extras/39618b926798ae2afee8c74abe65e541.mp4?t=1762522104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>MAIN FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing-Action Extravaganza:</strong>\u00a0 Why wait for the fish to bite, if you can race it? Chase giant fish with your car while trying to catch them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story full of characters:</strong> Meet grumpy mermen, bad songwriters, mythological beings, mechanical shopkeepers and more. They are on their journey, just as you are on yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Unlock new parts for your car, customize its loadout and paint jobs to catch fish your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gotta Snatch \u2019Em All:</strong> Catalog the colorful fauna and uncover its weird origin.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discovery:</strong> Long forgotten tunnels, giant skeletons, holes in space and time, and, yes, even a burger joint is here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snackable:</strong> Play a tight gaming experience, perfect for some evenings or a long weekend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.............................................................................................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi it's Jonas, the developer! :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HEART DRIVE has been a passion project of mine for some time now. It's something I put all my love into, but also something I have to do on the side for now. If you want to stay in touch, or have questions, follow me on Bluesky or Insta. Wishlists help a lot, as always, and look out for any future demo!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>See you, tape fishers! \u270c\ufe0f\ud83c\udfa3\ud83d\ude97</i></p>","developers":["Jonas Pfeiffer"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"des